 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Kirawaremono no Reijou wa, Watashi ga Aishimashou. ~Imasara Dekiai shite Kite mo, Mou Osoi desu!~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "嫌われ者の令嬢は、私が愛しましょう。～いまさら溺愛してきても、もう遅いです！～"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Hated Noblewoman… I’ll Be the One to Love Her. As for the Rest of You—You’re Far Too Late!"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "After dying alone, office worker Aki awakens to find her soul inside the body of a noblewoman named Isabelle, a girl from a powerful ducal family.\n\nIsabelle was known for being arrogant and hated by all—\nHer family ignored her, and even the one she loved coldly rejected her.\nShe died unloved, with a shattered heart.\n\nBut Aki, who also suffered from loneliness in her previous life, made a firm decision:\n“If no one else will love her… then I will.”\n\nHowever, she soon starts noticing strange things about the people around her…\nWas everything she thought she knew about “Isabelle” really true?\nOr are there hidden truths that were never told?"
  },
